flowchart TD
  Start([Student opens menu]) --> Browse[Browse and filter active menu]
  Browse --> Select[Add available items to cart]
  Select --> Submit[Submit order]
  Submit --> SignIn{Student signed in?}
  SignIn -- No --> Login[Sign in or register]
  Login --> Submit
  SignIn -- Yes --> Validate[Validate IDs, quantities and note]
  Validate --> Valid{Input valid?}
  Valid -- No --> Error[Show validation error]
  Valid -- Yes --> Check[Recheck item activity, availability and prices]
  Check --> Available{All available?}
  Available -- No --> Conflict[Reject order and ask student to refresh]
  Available -- Yes --> Save[Save order, lines and initial event atomically]
  Save --> Confirmation[Show code and pending status]
  Error --> Browse
  Conflict --> Browse
  Confirmation --> End([Track status])
